  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t01. Tuning**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t02. Phantom Island**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t03. Deadstick**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t04. Lonely Cosmos**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t05. Eternal Return**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t06. Pansych**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t07. Spacesick**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **KGLW2025-07-30t08. Aerodynamic**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-07-30** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 131 min; rated 1.67/5 by 3 [1]\n- **kglw2025-07-30.orchestra**: source not stated; 18 songs; 124 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Orchestra of St. Luke’s performed parts one, two, and four [1]\n- Sarah Hicks conducted the Orchestra of St. Luke’s at Westville Music Bowl [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-07-30**: taped by August West; transferred by August West; source: Channels 1 & 2: Se7 > Tascam 70D > SD > RCA Combiner > Marantz PMD221 [1]. Also: Recorded via Se7 into Tascam 70D, then Marantz PMD221, edited in Logic Pro [1]\n- **kglw2025-07-30.orchestra**: taped by Bootsy Jacobs [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by BerryLittles: [Official Poster King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Westville Music Bowl In New Haven CT On July 30 2025 t-shirt, hoodie,](https://berrylittles.com/product/official-poster-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-westville-music-bowl-in-new-haven-ct-on-july-30-2025-t-shirt/) [7]\n- Poster by Teesprime: [Original King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Westville Music Bowl in New Haven CT July 30 2025 Poster T Shirt, hoodie, sw](https://teesprime.com/product/original-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-westville-music-bowl-in-new-haven-ct-july-30-2025-poster-t-shirt/) [8]\n- Poster by Teesprime: [Original King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Westville Music Bowl in New Haven CT July 30 2025 Poster T Shirt, hoodie, sw](https://teesprime.com/product/original-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-westville-music-bowl-in-new-haven-ct-july-30-2025-poster-t-shirt/) [9]\n- Fan art by @picturestees: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Orchestra New Haven Connecticut 2025 Gig Poster At Westville Music Bowl On July 30 20](https://picturestees.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-orchestra-new-haven-connecticut-2025-gig-poster-at-westville-music-bowl-on-july-30-2025-tennis-courts-poster-t-shirt/) [10]",
